<p>American freelance journalist Shelly Kittleson was released in Iraq on April 7, about a week after she was abducted in Baghdad on March 31, according to Iraqi officials and US Secretary of State Marco Rubio.</p><img src='https://kagiproxy.com/img/2ShupMXJLUTh0RmE9xPmtYCsgxLJ-lKy3-g80ehy2Dz0WZYGZwIGoGrPZ4K6Int_iiJ4D2fOTZwtIyJAly_QESlpLKnOZHh4iuDYjVnwD6uxOaX_sL6AZ4hTsuMrTezeS8KOfrogDzKs4sDQh_zyu6GxSJi7KTB76J3YzHXNN6PQgqGHEQK3tTgMw10yn4Z2F1GcLMnMOEyiPvDFY5G5RGb6XtfbpIu_U8q77j7eEf2tHMppg8XOx-bJ4yRzO6hqRT_Day8Gr6yhfEVIsg' alt='US journalist Shelly Kittleson poses for a picture in Baghdad on March 31, 2026. Kittleson was kidnapped on March 31, in Baghdad by a suspected Iranian-backed Iraqi armed group, the United States said, as regional security deteriorates following the US-Israeli attack on Iran.' /><br /><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Freelance risks: Euronews said Kittleson, like many freelancers, often worked on a shoestring budget and without the institutional protections that staff reporters at large news organizations have.</li><li>US coordination: Rubio said officials from the Pentagon, the FBI, and the Iraqi Supreme Judicial Council helped secure Kittleson’s release.</li><li>Regional timing: Al-Monitor reported that her release was announced hours before the United States and Iran agreed to a ceasefire after more than a month of war that had spread across the region.</li></ul><blockquote>We are relieved that this American is now free and are working to support her safe departure from Iraq - Marco Rubio</blockquote><h3>Perspectives:</h3><ul><li>Kataib Hezbollah: The armed group said it had decided to free Kittleson and, according to several reports, said she must leave Iraq immediately. (<a href='https://www.cbsnews.com/news/shelly-kittleson-journalist-released-kidnap-iraq-iran-war-khataib-hezbollah/'>CBS News</a>)</li><li>Iraqi officials: Officials cited by The New York Times said the release was tied to the freeing of militia members, suggesting Iraqi mediation involved an exchange rather than a unilateral gesture. (<a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/04/07/world/middleeast/shelly-kittleson-journalist-iraq.html'>The New York Times</a>)</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='http://www.euronews.com/2026/04/07/iran-backed-iraqi-militia-says-it-will-release-abducted-us-journalist-shelly-kittleson'>US journalist Shelly Kittleson released by Iraqi militant group, official says</a> - euronews.com</li><li><a href='https://www.straitstimes.com/world/middle-east/iraqi-armed-group-says-it-will-release-abducted-us-journalist-says-she-must-leave-iraq-immediately'>Abducted US journalist released by Iraqi armed group, Rubio says</a> - straitstimes.com</li><li><a href='https://www.scmp.com/news/world/middle-east/article/3349310/pro-iran-group-says-will-release-us-journalist-kidnapped-iraq'>Abducted American journalist Kittleson released by Iraqi armed group, Rubio says</a> - scmp.com</li><li><a href='https://www.boston.com/news/media/2026/04/07/american-journalist-shelly-kittleson-has-been-released-an-iraqi-official-tells-the-ap/'>American journalist Shelly Kittleson has been released, an Iraqi official tells the AP</a> - boston.com</li><li><a href='https://www.thehindu.com/news/international/american-journalist-shelly-kittleson-released-say-iraqi-officials/article70835738.ece'>American journalist Shelly Kittleson released, say Iraqi officials</a> - thehindu.com</li><li><a href='https://www.ndtv.com/world-news/kidnapped-us-journalist-shelly-kittleson-released-from-iraq-after-a-week-11326034#publisher=newsstand'>Kidnapped US Journalist Shelly Kittleson Released From Iraq After A Week</a> - ndtv.com</li><li><a href='https://www.theglobeandmail.com/world/article-american-journalist-shelly-kittleson-iraq/'>U.S. journalist Shelly Kittleson has been released, Iraqi officials say</a> - theglobeandmail.com</li><li><a href='https://www.pbs.org/newshour/world/kidnapped-american-journalist-shelly-kittleson-has-been-released-iraqi-official-says'>Kidnapped American journalist Shelly Kittleson has been released, Iraqi official says</a> - pbs.org</li><li><a href='https://www.cbsnews.com/news/shelly-kittleson-journalist-released-kidnap-iraq-iran-war-khataib-hezbollah/'>U.S. journalist Shelly Kittleson released after kidnapping in Iraq</a> - cbsnews.com</li><li><a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/04/07/world/middleeast/shelly-kittleson-journalist-iraq.html'>Shelly Kittleson, American Journalist Abducted in Iraq, Is Freed</a> - nytimes.com</li><li><a href='https://www.bbc.com/news/articles/crm1xjp08k3o'>US journalist Shelly Kittleson released after kidnap in Iraq, officials say</a> - bbc.com</li><li><a href='https://www.al-monitor.com/originals/2026/04/iraqi-armed-group-releases-us-journalist'>Iraqi armed group releases US journalist</a> - al-monitor.com</li><li><a href='https://www.jpost.com/middle-east/article-892340'>Kata&#x27;ib Hezbollah announces the release of Shelly Kittleson, an American journalist who was kidnapped by gunmen in Baghdad on March 31st. The group&#x27;s condition for Kittleson&#x27;s freedom is her departure from Iraq.</a> - jpost.com</li></ul>